  "About": {
    "story": "I’ve always felt like a bit of a misfit.\n\nCurious, restless, and never very good at accepting “that’s just how it is.”\n\nThat curiosity took me from pre-med to architecture, designing at startup speed across continents, and eventually in world class research labs.\n\nI’ve changed directions more than once, usually because I found something new I couldn’t stop thinking about.\n\nNow, that something is product design.\n\nI’m still learning, still experimenting, and definitely still figuring things out.\n\nBut I’m excited to put my head down, do the work, and see where this next chapter takes me.\n\nA la vida,\n\n- David",
