      "problemTitle": "Tagged fabric swatches can open data.\nYet they still don't move the work forward.",
      "problemBody": "Fashion & apparel teams must test, document and approve every new material before a factory can use it. That information remains split across samples, inboxes, spreadsheets, lab reports and PLMs.",
